<%= header_section(@subject) %>
<div>
  <p>
    Your <%= @resource_subscription.resource_name %> webhook<%= " for #{@application_name}" if @application_name.present? %>
    is still listed as active, but we are not able to send anything to it, so you are not receiving
    notifications for these events.
  </p>
  <% if @missing_post_url %>
    <p>
      The webhook does not have a URL to send to. Add one and we will start sending
      <%= @resource_subscription.resource_name %> notifications from your next sale onwards.
    </p>
  <% else %>
    <p>
      The application that created this webhook no longer has permission to read your sales, which
      is required for us to send it. Re-authorize the application and we will start sending
      <%= @resource_subscription.resource_name %> notifications from your next sale onwards.
    </p>
  <% end %>
  <p>
    You can review your webhooks and set a notification URL directly under
    <%= link_to "advanced settings", settings_advanced_url %>, and read how these notifications work
    on our <%= link_to "ping documentation", ping_url %>.
  </p>
</div>
